*HEADING
Official-like cantilever with PART/ASSEMBLY/INSTANCE
*PREPRINT, ECHO=NO, MODEL=NO
*PART, NAME=BEAM_PART
*INCLUDE, INPUT=official_cantilever_mesh.inc
*MATERIAL, NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
210000,0.3
*DENSITY
7.85E-9
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=EALL, MATERIAL=STEEL
,
*END PART
*ASSEMBLY, NAME=A1
*INSTANCE, NAME=BEAM_INST, PART=BEAM_PART
*END ASSEMBLY
*NSET, NSET=FIX
1,
*STEP, NLGEOM=YES, INC=100
*STATIC
*BOUNDARY
FIX,1,1,0.0
*CLOAD
8,1,5.0
*OUTPUT
*NODE OUTPUT
U,RF
*ELEMENT OUTPUT
S,E
*END STEP
